I left out the two operations requests. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, so it has no filesystem access for `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` and no `http-client` access for the metadata service. Granting either would mean widening the node's authority in the graph, so those calls belong in a node that is granted that capability.

